Pokémon Emerald 3Ds Dual Screen changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: German ending tilemap
Applies after 0050-italian-ending-tilemap.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

The German ROM draws "THE END" with a pre-rendered tilemap (the German
graphics/credits/german_the_end.bin.lz in the German tree), the same way the
Spanish, French and Italian ones do: tools/localize_german.py ships it as
graphics/credits/german_the_end.bin.lz.

--- a/src/credits.c
+++ b/src/credits.c
@@ -126,2 +126,4 @@
 static const u32 sItalianTheEnd_Tilemap[] = INCBIN_U32("graphics/credits/italian_the_end.bin.lz");
+#elif defined(PORT_BRIDGE) && GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_GERMAN
+static const u32 sGermanTheEnd_Tilemap[] = INCBIN_U32("graphics/credits/german_the_end.bin.lz");
 #endif
@@ -1344,2 +1346,4 @@
     LZ77UnCompVram(sItalianTheEnd_Tilemap, (void *)(VRAM + offset));
+#elif defined(PORT_BRIDGE) && GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_GERMAN
+    LZ77UnCompVram(sGermanTheEnd_Tilemap, (void *)(VRAM + offset));
 #else
